{"3448380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Keep It Running: Together", "steam_appid": 3448380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/extras/8bc4d8db386d827e7ee7014622f0efc8.avif?t=1782219168\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill the quotas before the time runs out. Shovel coal into the Boilers, fix any machines that break down and get those boxes filled up with cursed children's toys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new shift brings new obstacles: from the toys springing to life and terrifying Clockwork Demons disrupting the machinery to the monstrous Competitors  intending to snatch you away to their mines. And... The ever watchful Boss whom you must never anger too much...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/extras/dde372224b162da8d482f887243bfdba.avif?t=1782219168\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever raced a 6-ton steam powered lorry? Experience the thrill and stress of controlling this massive vehicle as you race to deliver the boxes to the various locations within the nearby town before the night ends. Fire up the boiler, slam the throttle but... don't lose your boxes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not the only one roaming the streets as each new delivery brings new obstacles. Things go bump in the night in this cursed town and once again you will have to deal with the monsters residing within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/extras/6124cfe3f0b2240a440945934f85de3c.avif?t=1782219168\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do well and be rewarded with new outfits, new challenges and new Achievements! Show your production prowess with that fancy hat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making it to the end of the most difficult shifts and deliveries rewards you with a Custom mode in which you can tweak the upcoming shift or delivery entirely to your liking. Do fun challenges, or torment your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/extras/574f7ba496efab712461185d14a7fef9.avif?t=1782219168\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with a team of up to 4 people,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty scaling based on team size,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes that can be unlocked separately,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration with configurable commands.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/extras/8bc4d8db386d827e7ee7014622f0efc8.avif?t=1782219168\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill the quotas before the time runs out. Shovel coal into the Boilers, fix any machines that break down and get those boxes filled up with cursed children's toys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new shift brings new obstacles: from the toys springing to life and terrifying Clockwork Demons disrupting the machinery to the monstrous Competitors  intending to snatch you away to their mines. And... The ever watchful Boss whom you must never anger too much...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/extras/dde372224b162da8d482f887243bfdba.avif?t=1782219168\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever raced a 6-ton steam powered lorry? Experience the thrill and stress of controlling this massive vehicle as you race to deliver the boxes to the various locations within the nearby town before the night ends. Fire up the boiler, slam the throttle but... don't lose your boxes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not the only one roaming the streets as each new delivery brings new obstacles. Things go bump in the night in this cursed town and once again you will have to deal with the monsters residing within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/extras/6124cfe3f0b2240a440945934f85de3c.avif?t=1782219168\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do well and be rewarded with new outfits, new challenges and new Achievements! Show your production prowess with that fancy hat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making it to the end of the most difficult shifts and deliveries rewards you with a Custom mode in which you can tweak the upcoming shift or delivery entirely to your liking. Do fun challenges, or torment your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/extras/574f7ba496efab712461185d14a7fef9.avif?t=1782219168\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with a team of up to 4 people,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty scaling based on team size,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes that can be unlocked separately,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration with configurable commands.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Keep an old haunted factory running at all costs in this horrifying co-op survive-the-night game. Keep the Boss happy and fend off the monsters that haunt the factory and the town as you race to produce and deliver cursed children's toys.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Dutch, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/header.jpg?t=1782219168", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/1196e22aceac8787403b672b4721a7470cc394ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782219168", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448380/1196e22aceac8787403b672b4721a7470cc394ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782219168", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 2100 or AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU recommended. GTX950 or Radeon HD 7970 with at least 3GB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This is the absolute minimum specs the game may run on.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 4460 or Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1060 or RX580 with at least 4GB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> At least 8GB of VRAM is needed for 1440p or higher.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum"